{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"سنن ابن ماجه","section":{"5":"Establishing the Prayer and the Sunnah Regarding Them"},"section_detail":{"5":{"hadithnumber_first":803,"hadithnumber_last":1432,"arabicnumber_first":803,"arabicnumber_last":1432,"name_native":"كتاب الصلاة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1393,"arabicnumber":1393,"text":"حدثنا محمد بن يحيى، حدثنا عبد الرزاق، عن معمر، عن الزهري، عن عبد الرحمن بن كعب بن مالك، عن ابيه، قال لما تاب الله عليه خر ساجدا","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":5,"hadith":591}}]}